WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.047 --> 00:00:05.692
"Whoa!" Ringo said.

2
00:00:05.693 --> 00:00:08.728
"Something is underground, Vern.

3
00:00:08.729 --> 00:00:12.319
It's stealing your crops!"

4
00:00:12.320 --> 00:00:20.207
Bot used her scanner.

5
00:00:20.208 --> 00:00:24.433
"A creature is underground," she said.

6
00:00:24.434 --> 00:00:26.852
"I can't see what it is.

7
00:00:26.853 --> 00:00:29.940
But it's long!"

8
00:00:29.941 --> 00:00:33.939
"Vern, do you know what it is?" Ringo asked.

9
00:00:33.940 --> 00:00:37.880
Vern shook his head. "I'm a new farmer.

10
00:00:37.881 --> 00:00:41.167
I just moved to this planet."

11
00:00:41.168 --> 00:00:45.758
"Bex isn't stealing your crops," Ringo said.

12
00:00:45.759 --> 00:00:50.986
Vern nodded and looked at his feet.

13
00:00:50.987 --> 00:01:04.836
"I'll call her," he said.

14
00:01:04.837 --> 00:01:09.114
"What do you want, Vern?" Bex asked.

15
00:01:09.115 --> 00:01:13.007
"I'm sorry," Vern said.

16
00:01:13.008 --> 00:01:16.588
"You didn't steal my crops."

17
00:01:16.589 --> 00:01:21.307
Bex sighed. "It's okay.

18
00:01:21.308 --> 00:01:25.366
Do you know who is stealing them?"

19
00:01:25.367 --> 00:01:29.463
"There's a creature underground," Vern said.

20
00:01:29.464 --> 00:01:31.468
"It's long and—"

21
00:01:31.469 --> 00:01:34.247
"Oh no!" Bex cried.

22
00:01:34.248 --> 00:01:36.067
"I'll be right there!"

23
00:01:36.068 --> 00:01:39.425
Vern hung up the phone. "Huh.

24
00:01:39.426 --> 00:01:44.947
Bex sounded worried—ahh!"

25
00:01:44.948 --> 00:01:47.289
Everyone fell through the ground!

26
00:01:47.290 --> 00:01:52.785
"Oof!" Ringo landed on a dirt floor.

27
00:01:52.786 --> 00:02:02.163
He looked around. "We're in a tunnel."

28
00:02:02.164 --> 00:02:09.313
Vern shook. "It's cold!"

29
00:02:09.314 --> 00:02:15.936
Ringo started to walk.

30
00:02:15.937 --> 00:02:18.714
"I see more tunnels."

31
00:02:18.715 --> 00:02:22.825
Rumble! Rumble!

32
00:02:22.826 --> 00:02:25.538
"Uh-oh," Bot said.

33
00:02:25.539 --> 00:02:28.338
"The creatures are coming!"

34
00:02:28.339 --> 00:02:37.490
Ringo gasped. "Giant worms!"

